# Next.js Project Structure
This project follows a specific directory structure:

- `src/app`: Next.js App Router files (page.tsx, layout.tsx)
- `src/components`: React components
- `src/hooks`: React hooks
- `src/lib`: Utility functions and game logic
- `src/styles`: Global styles and SCSS variables
- `src/data`: JSON data files for game prompts and content

# Organization
Always organize files in subfolders by business function/domain.
